+/* THE WORDS KEEP A READING WIDTH (audit, 21 Nov 2026). The card is a row, and its three buttons never gave way: in the thread pane beside the list (328px at 1024, 584 at 1280) the words were laid out at zero width, one to a line down an 890px card, with "Decline & block" printed over them. The words take at least 18rem, and the buttons go under them when the two do not fit side by side. */
